      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `3199044e7591422e67a3254aa92b97e18e98c5e25bf4174648082a06726fc335--4515dc001_201112.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Federal Defendants, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2011-12\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 16 of 16\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 7f684b7efdcb7cc9c5066f4782e27e170807fed6feef811c12badb57ca92a5b9 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 682cc912310184e8ef75a16008fff4ed22e44b30c315e84a699b80d91227833d | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 17925aa62bc70930187adfd43e5ca88fd0abc1ee043c2f5e892127f317ddf666 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 4ff676c0031f6a34b5915bf7f8b314807ea69395129f7953e4362a907f8683e1 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 6d97d7afc4c8d5291a543a8f2e780c6b351e468a12a61ee5dde402d388d00870 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 0cc90d28e133c3dcfe8471752672a19212fc4e5b95e4201e7658afe0f8c7e71a | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 8660e1a9f2e5c3a59b329ea6accde282105470966a3ddf470b09ad55fa4d20cd | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 9e8990afb6b292f8677f5219e5277bc65c419fbfafb6eb5c6a9987c4a5592ddd | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | a88dafcc6a076b8685b0dc47e1d5eb212cbbe56496e34c1f6f2c02bd8f7cdc7f | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 2ea838d83eb8f427aaa308c8fb2e8ccc7310b426adf89cdb5835fad81e5a13c0 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | cfd901a975ed18a40bf521094065cd77aaead3d9bd7aaa39eb0ac44bcd8fc4c6 | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | 9c3816d32c99c31d0188a19c39b7317bf38a28c1f33d740df0ea88c4faf394f9 | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | ebca33a7d848ee2d67339657ab1212b816af3e186ee329337edec844e768e76e | missing |\n| \"Table_13\" | 4fd28487bccded58b0863dd85e3b30bbc4679ed64a4bfff05b378223897ba407 | missing |\n| \"Table_14\" | c7322d95105ddbc2b95d4f4d2f5ec005c6b2d5f1ef8a5db427a27854ab1d88c5 | missing |\n| \"Table_15\" | 2cf58e7179c8574d9a70d4ea199a88507ce278d017f6b9f16527340de1b911a0 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemo